nd on a paired board in heads-up after all checks, your hand is likely medium-weak but can win at showdown against busted draws. Betting risks folding worse and getting called or raised by better hands, so checking to realize your equity and possibly win the pot if opponent has nothing is better.\n\n**Answer:** 0'}
